IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1, section 102(e) (piece dg1): reserving the exclusive right to
-- use a corporate name. Layer 1: the law, objectively; nobody's point of view.
--
-- Source: de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, a plain-text rendering of the Delaware Code Online, not the
-- official text. `-- src:N | ...` is a slice of line N; an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- The Secretary of State is an official: no seat. What the Secretary of State must do appears as what it means for
-- the applicant. The text counts a reservation "for a period of 120 days" and renewals for "successive 120-day
-- periods"; the reservation is read as lasting through the 120th day after the day it is made, and each renewal
-- adds 120 days (Fork register).

§ `Section 102(e) -- Reserving a name`

-- src:70 | (e) The exclusive right to the use of a name that is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation may be reserved by or on behalf of:
-- src:71 | (1) Any person intending to incorporate or organize a corporation with that name under this chapter or contemplating such incorporation or organization;
-- src:72 | (2) Any domestic corporation or any foreign corporation qualified to do business in the State of Delaware, in either case, intending to change its name or contemplating such a change;
-- src:73 | (3) Any foreign corporation intending to qualify to do business in the State of Delaware and adopt that name or contemplating such qualification and adoption; and
-- src:74 | (4) Any person intending to organize a foreign corporation and have it qualify to do business in the State of Delaware and adopt that name or contemplating such organization, qualification and adoption.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:70-74)
DECLARE `s 102(e) Person reserving the name` IS ONE OF
    `a person intending to incorporate or organize a corporation with that name under this chapter, or contemplating such incorporation or organization`
    `a domestic corporation or a foreign corporation qualified to do business in the State of Delaware, intending to change its name or contemplating such a change`
    `a foreign corporation intending to qualify to do business in the State of Delaware and adopt that name, or contemplating such qualification and adoption`
    `a person intending to organize a foreign corporation and have it qualify to do business in the State of Delaware and adopt that name, or contemplating such organization, qualification and adoption`
    `another person`

-- The exclusive right to use a name that is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation may be reserved by
-- or on behalf of the four kinds of person listed. The list is read as exhaustive (Fork register).
-- src:70 | (e) The exclusive right to the use of a name that is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation may be reserved by or on behalf of:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:70)
GIVEN who IS A `s 102(e) Person reserving the name`
      `the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the exclusive right to use the name may be reserved by or on behalf of the person` who `the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation` MEANS
        `the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation`
    AND (CONSIDER who
         WHEN `a person intending to incorporate or organize a corporation with that name under this chapter, or contemplating such incorporation or organization` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a domestic corporation or a foreign corporation qualified to do business in the State of Delaware, intending to change its name or contemplating such a change` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a foreign corporation intending to qualify to do business in the State of Delaware and adopt that name, or contemplating such qualification and adoption` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a person intending to organize a foreign corporation and have it qualify to do business in the State of Delaware and adopt that name, or contemplating such organization, qualification and adoption` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `another person` THEN FALSE)

-- The application: executed by the applicant, certifying that the reservation is made by or on behalf of a
-- domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4), and specifying the
-- name to be reserved and the name and address of the applicant.
-- src:75 | The reservation of a specified name may be made by filing with the Secretary of State an application, executed by the applicant, certifying that the reservation is made by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4) of this section above, and specifying the name to be reserved and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
DECLARE `s 102(e) Application to reserve a name` HAS
    `the application is executed by the applicant`                                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application certifies that the reservation is made by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application specifies the name to be reserved`                                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application specifies the name and address of the applicant`                                              IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:75 | The reservation of a specified name may be made by filing with the Secretary of State an application, executed by the applicant, certifying that the reservation is made by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4) of this section above, and specifying the name to be reserved and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN a IS AN `s 102(e) Application to reserve a name`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the application to reserve a name is in the form required` a MEANS
        a's `the application is executed by the applicant`
    AND a's `the application certifies that the reservation is made by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4)`
    AND a's `the application specifies the name to be reserved`
    AND a's `the application specifies the name and address of the applicant`

-- If the Secretary of State finds that the name is available, the Secretary of State shall reserve it for the
-- applicant's use for 120 days. The finding is the Secretary of State's: an input.
-- src:75 | If the Secretary of State finds that the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation, the Secretary shall reserve the name for the use of the applicant for a period of 120 …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN `the application to reserve a name is in the form required` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Secretary of State finds that the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the Secretary of State must reserve the name for the applicant for a period of 120 days` `the application to reserve a name is in the form required` `the Secretary of State finds that the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation` MEANS
        `the application to reserve a name is in the form required`
    AND `the Secretary of State finds that the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation`

-- The reservation lasts through the 120th day after the day it is made; each renewal adds 120 days.
-- src:75 | If the Secretary of State finds that the name is available for use by a domestic or foreign corporation, the Secretary shall reserve the name for the use of the applicant for a period of 120 …
-- src:75 | The same applicant may renew for successive 120-day periods a reservation of a specified name by filing with the Secretary of State, prior to the expiration of such reservation (or renewal thereof), an application for renewal of such reservation, executed by the applicant, certifying that the reservation is renewed by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4) of this section above and specifying the name reservation to be renewed and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN `the date on which the name was reserved` IS A DATE
      `the number of times the reservation has been renewed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`s 102(e) the last day of the reservation` `the date on which the name was reserved` `the number of times the reservation has been renewed` MEANS
    `the date` (`period in days` (120 TIMES (`the number of times the reservation has been renewed` PLUS 1))) `after` `the date on which the name was reserved`

-- The same applicant may renew for successive 120-day periods by filing, prior to the expiration of the
-- reservation (or renewal), an application for renewal, executed by the applicant, certifying that the
-- reservation is renewed by or on behalf of a person described in (e)(1)-(4) and specifying the reservation to be
-- renewed and the name and address of the applicant. A filing on the last day of the reservation is prior to its
-- expiration (the last day is inside).
-- src:75 | The same applicant may renew for successive 120-day periods a reservation of a specified name by filing with the Secretary of State, prior to the expiration of such reservation (or renewal thereof), an application for renewal of such reservation, executed by the applicant, certifying that the reservation is renewed by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4) of this section above and specifying the name reservation to be renewed and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
DECLARE `s 102(e) Application for renewal` HAS
    `the application for renewal is executed by the applicant`                                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application for renewal certifies that the reservation is renewed by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application for renewal specifies the name reservation to be renewed`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application for renewal specifies the name and address of the applicant`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date on which the application for renewal was filed with the Secretary of State`                         IS A DATE

-- src:75 | The same applicant may renew for successive 120-day periods a reservation of a specified name by filing with the Secretary of State, prior to the expiration of such reservation (or renewal thereof), an application for renewal of such reservation, executed by the applicant, certifying that the reservation is renewed by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4) of this section above and specifying the name reservation to be renewed and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN a IS AN `s 102(e) Application for renewal`
      `the last day of the reservation or of the renewal` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the application for renewal renews the reservation` a `the last day of the reservation or of the renewal` MEANS
        a's `the application for renewal is executed by the applicant`
    AND a's `the application for renewal certifies that the reservation is renewed by or on behalf of a domestic corporation, foreign corporation or other person described in paragraphs (e)(1)-(4)`
    AND a's `the application for renewal specifies the name reservation to be renewed`
    AND a's `the application for renewal specifies the name and address of the applicant`
    AND (a's `the date on which the application for renewal was filed with the Secretary of State` AT MOST `the last day of the reservation or of the renewal`)

-- The right to the exclusive use of a reserved name may be transferred to any other person by filing a notice of the
-- transfer, executed by the applicant for whom the name was reserved, specifying the reservation to be transferred
-- and the name and address of the transferee.
-- src:75 | The right to the exclusive use of a reserved name may be transferred to any other person by filing in the office of the Secretary of State a notice of the transfer, executed by the applicant for whom the name was reserved, specifying the name reservation to be transferred and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
DECLARE `s 102(e) Notice of transfer` HAS
    `the notice of transfer is filed in the office of the Secretary of State`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice of transfer is executed by the applicant for whom the name was reserved`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice of transfer specifies the name reservation to be transferred`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice of transfer specifies the name and address of the transferee`                                      IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:75 | The right to the exclusive use of a reserved name may be transferred to any other person by filing in the office of the Secretary of State a notice of the transfer, executed by the applicant for whom the name was reserved, specifying the name reservation to be transferred and the name and address of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN n IS A `s 102(e) Notice of transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the right to the exclusive use of the reserved name has been transferred` n MEANS
        n's `the notice of transfer is filed in the office of the Secretary of State`
    AND n's `the notice of transfer is executed by the applicant for whom the name was reserved`
    AND n's `the notice of transfer specifies the name reservation to be transferred`
    AND n's `the notice of transfer specifies the name and address of the transferee`

-- The reservation may be cancelled by filing a notice of cancellation, executed by the applicant or transferee,
-- specifying the reservation to be cancelled and the name and address of the applicant or transferee.
-- src:75 | The reservation of a specified name may be cancelled by filing with the Secretary of State a notice of cancellation, executed by the applicant or transferee, specifying the name reservation to be cancelled and the name and address of the applicant or …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
DECLARE `s 102(e) Notice of cancellation` HAS
    `the notice of cancellation is filed with the Secretary of State`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice of cancellation is executed by the applicant or transferee`                                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice of cancellation specifies the name reservation to be cancelled`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice of cancellation specifies the name and address of the applicant or transferee`                     IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:75 | The reservation of a specified name may be cancelled by filing with the Secretary of State a notice of cancellation, executed by the applicant or transferee, specifying the name reservation to be cancelled and the name and address of the applicant or …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN n IS A `s 102(e) Notice of cancellation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the reservation has been cancelled` n MEANS
        n's `the notice of cancellation is filed with the Secretary of State`
    AND n's `the notice of cancellation is executed by the applicant or transferee`
    AND n's `the notice of cancellation specifies the name reservation to be cancelled`
    AND n's `the notice of cancellation specifies the name and address of the applicant or transferee`

-- Unless the Secretary of State finds that an application, application for renewal, notice of transfer or notice of
-- cancellation does not conform to law, upon receipt of all filing fees the Secretary of State shall prepare and
-- return to the person who filed it a copy of the filed instrument with a notation of the action taken.
-- src:75 | Unless the Secretary of State finds that any application, application for renewal, notice of transfer, or notice of cancellation filed with the Secretary of State as required by this subsection does not conform to law, upon receipt of all filing fees required by law the Secretary of State shall prepare and return to the person who filed such instrument a copy of the filed instrument with a notation thereon of the action taken by the Secretary of …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN `the Secretary of State finds that the instrument does not conform to law` IS A BOOLEAN
      `all filing fees required by law have been received` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(e) the Secretary of State must return a copy of the filed instrument with a notation of the action taken` `the Secretary of State finds that the instrument does not conform to law` `all filing fees required by law have been received` MEANS
        (NOT (`the Secretary of State finds that the instrument does not conform to law`))
    AND `all filing fees required by law have been received`

-- A fee as set forth in section 391 (piece dg11) is paid at the time of the reservation, of the renewal, and of the
-- filing of a notice of transfer or cancellation. The amount is an input; any other filing is not covered by this
-- sentence (NOTHING).
-- src:75 | A fee as set forth in § 391 of this title shall be paid at the time of the reservation of any name, at the time of the renewal of any such reservation and at the time of the filing of a notice of the transfer …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
DECLARE `s 102(e) Filing concerning a reservation` IS ONE OF
    `the reservation of a name`
    `the renewal of a reservation`
    `the filing of a notice of the transfer of a reservation`
    `the filing of a notice of the cancellation of a reservation`
    `another filing`

-- src:75 | A fee as set forth in § 391 of this title shall be paid at the time of the reservation of any name, at the time of the renewal of any such reservation and at the time of the filing of a notice of the transfer …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(e) (src:75)
GIVEN filing IS A `s 102(e) Filing concerning a reservation`
      `the amount payable under § 391 for the filing, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 102(e) the fee payable at the time of the filing` filing `the amount payable under § 391 for the filing, in dollars` MEANS
    -- out of range: section 391 (piece dg11) sets the amounts
    CONSIDER filing
    WHEN `the reservation of a name` THEN JUST `the amount payable under § 391 for the filing, in dollars`
    WHEN `the renewal of a reservation` THEN JUST `the amount payable under § 391 for the filing, in dollars`
    WHEN `the filing of a notice of the transfer of a reservation` THEN JUST `the amount payable under § 391 for the filing, in dollars`
    WHEN `the filing of a notice of the cancellation of a reservation` THEN JUST `the amount payable under § 391 for the filing, in dollars`
    WHEN `another filing` THEN NOTHING
